    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 102,
        "endOffset": 128,
        "text": "a whole other can of worms",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3E826C3B03",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 75,
        "endOffset": 95,
        "text": "you would need to do",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C6B065FC9A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 65,
        "text": "But studies like that are expensive and complicated to carry out.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A687AA1032",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 62,
        "text": "So with no adequate data, I decided to seek professional help.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "91D0603698",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 33,
        "text": "I went to couples therapists, Dr.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "96B9FFC91E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "Hod Tamir.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "170C938531",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 123,
        "text": "He has anecdotal experience with countless people in relationships and, full disclosure, he was my couple’s therapist, too.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B7E594885E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 65,
        "text": "So I asked him how long he thinks it takes to get over a breakup.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4A2F7147FC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 42,
        "text": "\"I don't think there is a magic number ...\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B594ADD2BC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 80,
        "endOffset": 98,
        "text": "keep it bottled up",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "114F7F9122",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 63,
        "endOffset": 79,
        "text": "we don't have to",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "698771BDA4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 205,
        "text": "feelings are not as raw",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "62E1DA79EA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 94,
        "endOffset": 107,
        "text": "you look back",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DE4DB913C5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 8,
        "endOffset": 46,
        "text": "bump into each other and not feel pain",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6091D3D1E0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 25,
        "text": "And the data supports Dr.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "253F562F24",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 15,
        "text": "Tamir's theory.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "98D09FE15B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 61,
        "text": "One study looked at different strategies for love regulation.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A32A15B8A5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 48,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "how much you love someone?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DD4F1DA4E0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 240,
        "text": "The study found that when participants were distracted into thinking about something other than their ex, like, their favorite hobby or ideal career, their love feelings for their ex stayed the same, but it did make them feel more pleasant.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "722432CD37",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 62,
        "text": "Using distractions to start to feel better is exactly what Dr.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C95216B8A6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 43,
        "endOffset": 58,
        "text": "is exactly what",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4923C193D9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 20,
        "text": "Tamir has suggested.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9F72D8B271",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 71,
        "endOffset": 126,
        "text": "remembering all of the shit things your ex said and did",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8E1723D425",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 94,
        "endOffset": 105,
        "text": "shit things",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "56A543B9BA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 73,
        "text": "But it also makes you feel \"unpleasant,\" and I'm guessing that means sad.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5527100ECE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "Finally, a third, more zen strategy known as reappraisal of love feelings.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6DFF3EF94A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 30,
        "endOffset": 50,
        "text": "muse over statements",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "840DE01B7F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 128,
        "text": "For this, participants had to muse over statements like \"Love is part of life\" and \"It's OK to love someone I'm no longer with.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DC53747F86",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 43,
        "text": "Yeah, that changed nothing at all for them.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1952675E9D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 58,
        "endOffset": 77,
        "text": "scientific language",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C5F72DD39C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 40,
        "endOffset": 82,
        "text": "I'm not using the scientific language here",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CDB52C22C5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 169,
        "text": "Overall, the researchers concluded, and I'm not using the scientific language here, that concentrating on the bad things about your ex can help you to feel less in love.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "74D1622495",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 109,
        "text": "While distracting yourself with other subjects, as my therapist suggested, can actually make you feel better.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C67B2B4EAE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "However, the research and Dr.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8CC035808C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 31,
        "endOffset": 106,
        "text": "while distraction is good in the short term, it is not a long-term solution",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D81FCEE97E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 107,
        "text": "Tamir would both tell you that while distraction is good in the short term, it is not a long-term solution.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AE50A0D6B0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 104,
        "text": "\"Taking that time to process and understand it is actually a much quicker way to heal than ignoring it.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B8B6618150",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 110,
        "text": "Eventually, for the sake of ourselves and our future partners, we're going to have to face up to our feelings.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "49721C1901",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 47,
        "text": "So how long does it take to get over a breakup?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DA8AAEF688",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
        "end": "40",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "Well, we don't have enough long-term studies to know.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "11924AC550",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "41",
        "end": "41",
        "startOffset": 40,
        "endOffset": 139,
        "text": "instead of counting down the days, we're much better off reconnecting with the things we love to do",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2327BD16AE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "41",
        "end": "41",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 140,
        "text": "But more importantly, I’ve learned that instead of counting down the days, we're much better off reconnecting with the things we love to do.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "294975B2B4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "42",
        "end": "42",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 77,
        "text": "Finding something to distract us and unpacking our feelings when we're ready.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1DFEE169E2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "43",
        "end": "43",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 78,
        "text": "If we can do all that, then one day hopefully we'll come out of it feeling OK.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D8C950E0A9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "44",
        "end": "44",
        "startOffset": 16,
        "endOffset": 51,
        "text": "isn't that what we're really after?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
